{"3951810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cheater's Table", "steam_appid": 3951810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY FAIR. DIE FIRST.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheater’s Table is a 2–4 player online card game of cheating and bluffing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empty your hand. Cheat. Catch cheaters. Don’t fall for traps. Control the table and stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIDE YOUR CARD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to play a card that doesn’t match the table?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide it in your sleeve or pant leg. Pull it out and play it when the time is right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If someone challenges you and finds it, you pay the price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If they fail, they do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/c7f3ca36e36a6d70a320b6c21fb59430.poster.avif?t=1788125129\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/c7f3ca36e36a6d70a320b6c21fb59430.webm?t=1788125129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/c7f3ca36e36a6d70a320b6c21fb59430.mp4?t=1788125129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DON’T TAKE THE BAIT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not every suspicious move is a cheat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge someone and you might walk straight into their trap. Ignore it, and the trap backfires on the player who set it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PICK YOUR PUNISHMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards, dynamites, or a Cadillac... What kind of trap do you want to set?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The host decides what kind of chaos takes over the table. Every punishment carries its own risk, and one wrong decision can completely change the course of the match.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY THE MILK. END THE MATCH.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Milk is your final card. Play it to win the match instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If nobody manages to play Milk, the last player alive wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/00f0200467e9f6acea51ee80c0c9e5f6.poster.avif?t=1788125129\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/00f0200467e9f6acea51ee80c0c9e5f6.webm?t=1788125129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/00f0200467e9f6acea51ee80c0c9e5f6.mp4?t=1788125129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SET UP YOUR OWN TABLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose total chaos with cheats, traps, and deadly punishments. Change the rules in Lab Mode and shape the game your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want a calmer table? Choose Old School and remove cheating entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set the rules. Pick your punishment. Invite your friends. Trust no one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/67f58d5b9c64dd2b7341493c3a6b1da2.poster.avif?t=1788125129\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/67f58d5b9c64dd2b7341493c3a6b1da2.webm?t=1788125129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/67f58d5b9c64dd2b7341493c3a6b1da2.mp4?t=1788125129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2–4 player online matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheat and cheat-catching system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-risk trap mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card, Cadillac, and dynamite punishments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant victory with Milk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheat-free Old School option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable room rules with Lab Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tournament Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple language support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorblind-friendly design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful Streamer Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over-the-top card game chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And details waiting to be discovered</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/c8944989f895086ece898d1501cf73aa.poster.avif?t=1788125129\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/c8944989f895086ece898d1501cf73aa.webm?t=1788125129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/c8944989f895086ece898d1501cf73aa.mp4?t=1788125129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>At this table, the cards are only half the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY FAIR. DIE FIRST.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheater’s Table is a 2–4 player online card game of cheating and bluffing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empty your hand. Cheat. Catch cheaters. Don’t fall for traps. Control the table and stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIDE YOUR CARD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to play a card that doesn’t match the table?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide it in your sleeve or pant leg. Pull it out and play it when the time is right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If someone challenges you and finds it, you pay the price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If they fail, they do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/c7f3ca36e36a6d70a320b6c21fb59430.poster.avif?t=1788125129\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/c7f3ca36e36a6d70a320b6c21fb59430.webm?t=1788125129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/c7f3ca36e36a6d70a320b6c21fb59430.mp4?t=1788125129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DON’T TAKE THE BAIT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not every suspicious move is a cheat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge someone and you might walk straight into their trap. Ignore it, and the trap backfires on the player who set it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PICK YOUR PUNISHMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards, dynamites, or a Cadillac... What kind of trap do you want to set?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The host decides what kind of chaos takes over the table. Every punishment carries its own risk, and one wrong decision can completely change the course of the match.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY THE MILK. END THE MATCH.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Milk is your final card. Play it to win the match instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If nobody manages to play Milk, the last player alive wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/00f0200467e9f6acea51ee80c0c9e5f6.poster.avif?t=1788125129\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/00f0200467e9f6acea51ee80c0c9e5f6.webm?t=1788125129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/00f0200467e9f6acea51ee80c0c9e5f6.mp4?t=1788125129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SET UP YOUR OWN TABLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose total chaos with cheats, traps, and deadly punishments. Change the rules in Lab Mode and shape the game your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want a calmer table? Choose Old School and remove cheating entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set the rules. Pick your punishment. Invite your friends. Trust no one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/67f58d5b9c64dd2b7341493c3a6b1da2.poster.avif?t=1788125129\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/67f58d5b9c64dd2b7341493c3a6b1da2.webm?t=1788125129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/67f58d5b9c64dd2b7341493c3a6b1da2.mp4?t=1788125129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2–4 player online matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheat and cheat-catching system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-risk trap mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card, Cadillac, and dynamite punishments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant victory with Milk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheat-free Old School option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable room rules with Lab Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tournament Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple language support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorblind-friendly design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful Streamer Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over-the-top card game chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And details waiting to be discovered</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/c8944989f895086ece898d1501cf73aa.poster.avif?t=1788125129\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/c8944989f895086ece898d1501cf73aa.webm?t=1788125129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/c8944989f895086ece898d1501cf73aa.mp4?t=1788125129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" styl